{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b015df98b34416d2a3d90d4d1eeb55f3f37f4ddc954f1c7c1f6d43e5fa2fea82", "ja": "（『アイドルヒーローズ・クロニクル』の公演準備が\n始まった。みんなも気合いがみなぎっている！）", "zh": "（《偶像英雄·编年史》的公演准备开始了。大家也都干劲十足！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "6b6e0e809ba9611ffa8f7f44eacf027c0ff1ad2c05c94a097e696991fbbb9976", "ja": "キネティック……\nエクストリ～……あ、あら！？　ああっ！", "zh": "动能……\n极限——……啊、哎呀！？啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4ee02ce0a52713454e7e789e2e9f5065f136577200563bd912585a718a1b5f14", "ja": "今の声は、あずささん！？", "zh": "刚才的声音是，梓小姐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1003_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8e02456e12da71e7673dd307c73e73ca31faa8bbee25ce6d8535b040c060ed5a", "ja": "あずささん、大丈夫ですか！", "zh": "阿梓莎小姐，您没事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "709b740a70faec57ea8607cbce4e270e437f2b2a2223df3ebfb175ed995a9660", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん？\n大丈夫ですけど……どうしました？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生？\n我没事……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e095ef4214f74d4b1d8040bab69123683c725134ad88febcdeeabfdccc607c7b", "ja": "いや、あずささんの声が聞こえたもので、\n何かあったのかと……。でも、何事もなくてよかった。", "zh": "没有，刚才听到了梓小姐的声音，\n还以为出了什么事……不过，没事就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "865ea0ce2005bc1333e5362142466e33be24a28503452574160d397729deb82a", "ja": "まぁ、そうだったんですね。\nご心配をおかけしてしまって、すみません。", "zh": "哎呀，原来是这样啊。\n让您担心了，真是不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "86d4b6e5ce84a4369e87f4fe7fe988dd2e46d67853d59cd186bb47bf5ee7df52", "ja": "でも、安心してください。\nちょっとバランスを崩してしまっただけですから。", "zh": "不过，请放心。\n只是稍微失去了一下平衡而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2b9692808f17028c83dc0ffe67dc61caee7178b80f5f0ef5668b7b472cb44709", "ja": "もしかして、アクションの練習中でしたか？", "zh": "难道刚才是在练习动作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "0232eb2e17f621b032021aa66a73e80089a3f7285f2de6ae3c77b0fd32afbe68", "ja": "はい。今回はアクションシーンが多いですから、\nいつも以上に練習が必要で……。", "zh": "是的。这次动作戏很多，所以需要比平时更加练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "53bad284ce4c6c98be7e7b043f394f2ed937368fd777b382c8d3276be8e8f74c", "ja": "みんなは気を遣ってくれるんです。\nもっと簡単な動きにしましょうか？とか……。", "zh": "大家都很体谅我。\n还会问“要不要改成更简单的动作？”之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "0ae9d1efb55cb21ae613ba6e8b385c17e0c40e7b53f27eb3c6322741c6fff4de", "ja": "でも、妥協はしたくなくて。私もヒーローとして、\nカッコ悪い姿はみせたくありませんから……、なんて。", "zh": "可是，我不想妥协。因为我作为英雄，也不想让大家看到自己狼狈的样子……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ddd00feb20408b95c3214ae0f787703d2d2204a0f806e415ed07f5a7e52490b3", "ja": "あずささん……。わかりました。\nでも、これだけは忘れないでください。", "zh": "秋月小姐……我明白了。\n但是，有一件事请您千万不要忘记。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1014_p", "source_sha256": "1ac3b8820a59112eb631084e57301f520238d16d58c3e570c93e5a9afb908f42", "ja": "あずささんも、ヒーローも。\n決して一人じゃありませんからね。", "zh": "秋月女士也好，英雄也好，都绝对不是孤身一人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "609a5ab24022cf3ab7532cc24cf901f06982648912b3782214ccfe5c28b847fc", "ja": "まぁ……。ふふっ、そうですね、本当にそう……。\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "嗯……呵呵，确实呢，真的就是这样……谢谢您，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "8d16902c285aba59b3c8e63107b77324e98995f5947eab6fdffc0b83b61e94bf", "ja": "いつも見守っていてくれて、何があってもすぐに\n駆けつけて、守ってくれる……。", "zh": "一直都在守护着我，无论发生什么都会立刻\n飞奔而来，保护着我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "3e5185ce8d714a4a7cb626b6c883c73054b6cafb5da5d015dc4499242d9aa1bd", "ja": "私も、そんなヒーローを演じてみたいと思います。\n誰からも愛される、頼もしい存在に……。", "zh": "我也想试着饰演那样的英雄。成为一个人人喜爱、可靠的存在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f6c91742a5eeed82123dbbfa2b8ac17c149555e2c2d2230ebb5fd72f1164ea22", "ja": "はい。俺もできる限りサポートしますから。\n何でも言ってください！", "zh": "好的。我也会尽我所能支持您的。\n有什么需要尽管告诉我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0523_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "0947d77463bf5375af2ebbf5025c123b40e15217761763eec097a4dc2714c4e8", "ja": "はーい♪　よくわかりました。\n私のヒーローさん♪　……うふふっ！", "zh": "好的♪我明白了。\n我的英雄先生♪……嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
